#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Mobile/Tooltips/MobileCharacterTooltip.cs
msgid "{claims}/{MaxShieldClaims} Shields"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEmotesPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Emotes<c/> are account-wide and let you react quickly in chat and gameplay.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Flow:<c/>\n"
"1) Select an emote slot at the top.\n"
"2) Click an owned emote to assign it.\n"
"3) Click the same slot again to clear selection.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Unlocks:<c/> Purchase from the emotes shop or package offers.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEssencesCollectPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Collect up to 3 different essences simultaneously to gain the ability to acquire those particular essences when a boss is defeated. Essences are not guranteed upon the death of a boss.\n"
"\n"
"Click an equipped essence or an empty slot to modify which one you're collecting."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEssencesExchangePageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Exchanging an essence for one of its Unique items is as easy as collecting the specified amount and clicking the item you want.\n"
"\n"
"Essence prices that are <c#0xee3636>red<c/> indicate you do not have enough of that essence type to exchange for the item."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEssencesMenuTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Essences serve as a [c#0xffff77]pity timer[c/], ensuring a chance for untiered items.\n"
"\n"
"By defeating enemies that Astake has uncovered the essence for, you unlock it. Start collecting that specific essence to have a chance to obtain it on boss death.\n"
"\n"
"You can collect up to 3 different essences simultaneously. Once you accumulate the required amount of essence for a specific item, you can exchange the essence for it.\n"
"\n"
"[c#ff7777]Note: Exchanging essence for an item will consume all collected essence, even if the item costs less than the total amount of that essence you have gathered.[c/]"
msgstr ""
"Эссенции служат [c#0xffff77]гарантированным таймером[c/], для обеспечения шанса особых предметов.\n"
"\n"
"Побеждая врагов, для которых Астак обнаружил эссенцию, вы открываете её. Начните собирать эту конкретную эссенцию — тогда появится шанс получить её при гибели босса.\n"
"\n"
"Вы можете собирать до трёх эссенций одновременно. Как только вы набираете достаточное количество эссенции для определенного предмета, вы можете обменять её на этот предмет.\n"
"\n"
"[c#ff7777]Внимание: Обмен эссенции на предмет потратит всю собранную эссенцию, даже если цена предмета меньше, чем количество собранной эссенции.[c/]"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopGravestonesPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Graves<c/> are account-wide cosmetics for the stone left where your character falls.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Tiers:<c/> Which stone you leave depends on the silver earned before dying. A pack has one for each tier.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Use:<c/> Pick a grave to see it, and Equip puts it in its tier.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

