#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopTitlesTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Titles<c/> are account-wide cosmetics shown in chat and on your player card.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Sources:<c/> Attainments, packages, shop rotations, and special events.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Use:<c/> Click any owned title to equip it immediately.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""
"<c#0xffff77>Титулы<c/> это украшения вашего аккаунта, отображаемые в чате и на вашей карточке игрока.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Источники:<c/> Достижения, наборы, ротации в магазине, и особые события.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Использование:<c/> Щелкните на любой, принадлежащий вам, титул, чтобы немедленно его экипировать.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>Все покупки возврату не подлежат.<c/>"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "<c#298e35>Affixes<c/> are rerolled whole: tick the affix and every bonus it grants rolls again, never landing on the same affix twice."
msgstr "<c#298e35>Аффиксы<c/> перебрасываются полностью: переключите аффикс и каждый бонус, который он даёт, еще раз перебросится, никогда не выпадая на тот же аффикс дважды."

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "Цена"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"30 x the item's base Item Power in silver (an item at 0 Item Power is priced as 1).\n"
"A duplicate of the item as fuel makes it free, a Divine Roll Scroll too;\n"
"a roll scroll takes 20% off, 40% at + and 60% at ++."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "Tiers"
msgstr "Уровни"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"A reroll can climb any number of tiers but drops at most one: a pink lands on blue or better,\n"
"a green on orange or better, a red anywhere. An event or HATED affix drops no lower than pink."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "Odds"
msgstr "Шансы"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Each tier has a weight - red 10, orange 20, green 40, blue 20, pink 10, event 5 where the item\n"
"has event affixes, HATED 10 for a HATED character spending a duplicate or for anyone rerolling\n"
"a HATED affix - and every affix of a tier is as likely as the next. A roll scroll's affix makes\n"
"the stats it lists more likely inside each tier: +30% weight for red, rising 30% a tier to +210%\n"
"for event. The Table shows every affix's chance."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "<c#298e35>Quality<c/> points are the item's + and ++. Tick a point to reroll which stat it boosts."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"5.625 x the item's base Item Power in silver per point.\n"
"A duplicate of the item as fuel makes it free; a roll scroll takes 20% off (40% at +, 60% at ++),\n"
"and other reroll tokens do not discount it.\n"
"An item at 0 Item Power is priced as 1."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "Upgrade Bar"
msgstr "Шкала улучшения"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "<c#298e35>Traits<c/> are made of points. Tick the points you want rerolled; they move to a different trait."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "Rerolling a whole trait"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Tick every point of a trait and the trait itself rerolls - its points may land anywhere,\n"
"including a trait the item did not have."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "<c#298e35>Oyun, the Mystical<c/> can imbue your items with magic to alter (reroll) their affix, quality and traits!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Silver, priced off the item's base Item Power: 30 x for the affix,\n"
"and 5.625 x for each quality point or trait point.\n"
"A duplicate of the item as fuel makes the whole reroll free. Fuel is used up by the reroll.\n"
"The silver also fills the item's upgrade bar toward its next + (see Quality)."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid "Free Affix Rerolls"
msgstr "Бесплатные Перебросы Аффиксов"

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"This fuel makes the affix reroll free. A duplicate of the item makes the quality\n"
"and trait points free as well; the Divine Roll Scroll and fragments do not."
msgstr ""
"Это топливо делает переброс аффикса бесплатным. Дубликат предмета делает качество\n"
"и очки черт также бесплатными; Божественный Свиток Переброса и фрагменты - нет."

