#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Leave this place..."
msgstr "Уходи отсюда..."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "You dare desecrate this hollow soil?"
msgstr "Ты смеешь осквернять эту пустую землю?"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your living kind has no right to be here."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Then you shall join us!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Intermediate/ButterflyWoodsBehaviors.cs
msgid "So be it..."
msgstr "Пусть будет так..."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "I will have no qualms devouring your soul."
msgstr "Я без колебаний поглощу твою душу."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Death dubs thee worthy of his ranks!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "@p, your soul shall make up for the ones you have extinguished!"
msgstr "@p, да возместит же твоя душа те, что ты погасил!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your final reward will only be death!"
msgstr "Твоей финальной наградой будет только смерть!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "The end is the same for everyone. You are no exception, @p."
msgstr "Конец один для всех. И ты не исключение, @p."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Die again! For His sake!"
msgstr "Умри снова! Во имя Его!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Lay down your souls once more!"
msgstr "Сдайте ваши души еще раз!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/DominionThicketBehaviors.cs
msgid "Protect the King!"
msgstr "Защитить Короля!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Sacrifices for the Void..."
msgstr "Жертвоприношения для Пустоты"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Ignorant fools..."
msgstr "Невежественные глупцы..."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Stand amongst the remains of the fallen..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Observe as the inferior flock towards their demise."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...What do you fight for?"
msgstr "...За что ты сражаешься?"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...You will join your brethren in The Beyond."
msgstr "...Ты присоединишься к своим собратьям в Запределье."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...You mortals will never learn."
msgstr "...Вам, смертным, никогда не научиться."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Why do you continue to struggle?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Your end is near."
msgstr "...Твой конец близок."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...These meaningless actions will result in nothing."
msgstr "...Эти бессмысленные действия ни к чему не приведут."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Where do you think all this noise will get you?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Death is inescapable."
msgstr "...От Смерти не убежать."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Meaningless actions such as yours will not be noticed."
msgstr "...Ваши бессмысленные действия останутся незамеченными."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Do you wish to join them?"
msgstr "...Ты желаешь присоединиться к ним?"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Do you wish to perish like them?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "...Do you wish to die like the rest?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Enough of these transgressions!"
msgstr "Достаточно этих нарушений!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "To waste all this time on trivial creatures such as you?!"
msgstr "Тратить всё это время на низших созданий, как вы?!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Fools! Truly thinking you have a greater purpose is absurd!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "This temple's treasure does not belong to you. Turn back, now."
msgstr "Сокровища этого храма тебе не принадлежат. Поворачивай назад, сейчас же."

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Then you shall pay with your life!"
msgstr "Тогда ты заплатишь за это своей жизнью!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Do not come back!"
msgstr "Не возвращайся обратно!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Enough of your foolish behavior!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Leave and do not return!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "You wish to fight none other than yourself."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "This path you blindly follow is misdirection."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "This crypt's gate will not fall!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Take heed! What lay inside should not be disturbed!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Turn back from whence you came!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Be gone from this place!"
msgstr "Прочь из этого места!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Legion, lend me your power!"
msgstr "Легион, одолжи мне свою мощь!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "The fire of Conquest does not easily burn out, mortal!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "I will show you the true nature of Corruption!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "I WILL NOT LET YOU REACH THE VOID!"
msgstr "Я НЕ ПОЗВОЛЮ ВАМ ДОБРАТЬСЯ ДО ПУСТОТЫ!"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
msgid "Are you free?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Dominion/EventBehaviors.cs
