#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "sorry... its been a bad day"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "thadacles is back! and i think i lost something in here."
