msgstr "Вы... угроза"

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Violence remains-- the last moral of objectivity."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "This is a sacred place."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "I will liberate you from this cycle."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Power usurped by force is not power at all."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "I must…. Preserve… The Truth!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
